# No Cursor co-author

Git commit messages **must not** include:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `git commit --trailer "Co-authored-by: ..."`

## Agent / maintainer

- Use plain `git commit -m "message"` only — no `--trailer`.
- Do not amend or rewrite commits to add Cursor attribution.
- Cursor IDE: **Settings → Git & PRs → Attribution** → off.
- Cursor CLI (`~/.cursor/cli-config.json`): `attribution.attributeCommitsToAgent: false`.

## Local guard (per clone)

```bash
node scripts/install-git-hooks.mjs
```

Strips `cursoragent@cursor.com` lines in `prepare-commit-msg` before the commit is recorded.
